      "cooked": "<p>Burn Everything Gaming is a podcast that my friend puts together and lets me play/GM&nbsp;a lot on. We play a lot of Fate-based games, blog about roleplaying in general, and just try to have a lot of fun!</p><p>This past week we tried out Roll20 to get a video stream for the podcast going, and the GtG guys were nice enough to let us try out the old pre-beta version of the Sentinels Comic RPG. Nothing new you can't read about on the old thread from when the RPG was announced, but if you want to talk a look here is the link.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ymj7oo0ZtSc&amp;feature-youtu.be\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ymj7oo0ZtSc&amp;feature-youtu.be</a></p>",
